---
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy and cookies | Iida Lehtonen"
  description="Information about privacy, analytics and cookies on iidalehtonen.com."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="privacy-page">
    <Container>
      <article class="privacy-content">
        <header>
          <p class="privacy-content__eyebrow">Last updated 17 July 2026</p>
          <h1>Privacy and cookies</h1>
          <p class="privacy-content__intro">
            This notice explains how iidalehtonen.com handles personal data and
            uses optional analytics.
          </p>
        </header>

        <h2>Data controller</h2>
        <p>
          Iida Lehtonen<br />
          <a href="mailto:iida.e.lehtonen@gmail.com">iida.e.lehtonen@gmail.com</a>
        </p>

        <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors use the
          site and to improve its content. Google Analytics is disabled by
          default and only loads after you choose “Accept analytics”.
        </p>
        <p>
          Analytics data can include pages visited, approximate location,
          device and browser information, referring pages, session information
          and interactions with the site. The site does not use Google Analytics
          for advertising or ad personalisation.
        </p>

        <h2>Legal basis and consent</h2>
        <p>
          The legal basis for analytics processing is your consent. You may
          decline analytics without losing access to any content or feature on
          the site.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
        <p>
          If you accept analytics, Google Analytics may set first-party cookies
          beginning with <code>_ga</code> to distinguish visits and sessions.
          Your consent choice is stored in your browser’s local storage so the
          site can remember it on later visits.
        </p>

        <h2>Changing your choice</h2>
        <p>
          You can reopen the consent controls at any time using “Cookie
          settings” in the footer. Declining after previously accepting stops
          future analytics collection and removes Google Analytics cookies set
          for this site where the browser permits it.
        </p>

        <h2>Service providers and international processing</h2>
        <p>
          The website is hosted by Vercel. Google provides the analytics
          service. These providers may process technical data outside your home
          country under their applicable data protection arrangements.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vercel Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on the applicable law, you may have rights concerning your
          personal data, including access, correction, deletion, restriction,
          objection and withdrawal of consent. You may also lodge a complaint
          with your local data protection authority. Contact the data controller
          using the email address above to make a request.
        </p>
      </article>
    </Container>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    padding-block: 5.5rem 0;
  }

  .privacy-content {
    width: min(100%, 50rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-top: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .privacy-content header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .privacy-content__eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .privacy-content h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 6rem);
  }

  .privacy-content__intro {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .privacy-content h2 {
    margin: 3rem 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .privacy-content p,
  .privacy-content ul {
    margin-block: 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .privacy-content a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .privacy-content code {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
